## Year 3 - Series A Required

Series A: $3-5M for expansion to 20 person team, $5M ARR target.

Key Assumptions:
- Customer acquisition cost: $200 (Pro), $5000 (Enterprise)
- Lifetime value: $1,500 (Pro), $50,000 (Enterprise)
- Churn: 5% monthly (Pro), 10% annual (Enterprise)
- Sales cycle: 1 month (Pro), 6 months (Enterprise)
